          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सौंपना — saumpnā — \"to entrust; to hand over\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जाने से पहले राजा ने क़िले की चाबी अपने बेटे को सौंपी। jāne se pahle rājā ne qile kī cābī apne beṭe ko saumpī. Before leaving, the king handed the key of the fort to his son."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने चाबी सौंपी, usne cābī saumpī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सौंपना (saumpnā) goes back to Sanskrit samarpayati, \"hands over\" (CDIAL 13192). What is handed over agrees with the verb: चाबी सौंपी; the person who receives it takes को."
            }
          ]
        },
